{"step_index":155,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-26T02:03:02Z","content":"Created At: 2026-10-26T10:03:02+08:00\nCompleted At: 2026-10-26T10:03:04+08:00\nShowing lines 1-120 of 757\n1: +++\n2: title = \"Android 显示系统架构：DisplayManagerService 与 SurfaceFlinger 双层显示管理机制\"\n3: date = 2026-10-12\n4: draft = false\n5: +++\n6: \n7: # Android 显示系统架构：DisplayManagerService 与 SurfaceFlinger 双层显示管理机制\n8: \n9: > **文档版本**: 2.0.0 (Comprehensive Edition)  \n10: > **状态**: 正式发布 (Approved)  \n11: > **涵盖模块**: DisplayManagerService (DMS), WindowManagerService (WMS), SurfaceFlinger (SF), CompositionEngine, HWComposer (HWC), Qualcomm SDM (Snapdragon Display Manager), Linux DRM/KMS  \n12: > **适用平台**: Android 10 ~ Android 14+ (包含 AOSP Phone/Tablet、Foldable 折叠屏、Android Automotive OS 车载多屏以及高通芯片座舱平台)\n13: \n14: ---\n15: \n16: ## 目录\n17: 1. [引言与架构全景](#1-引言与架构全景)\n18: 2. [显示管理的核心双层语义](#2-显示管理的核心双层语义)\n19: 3. [第一层语义：物理显示设备的生命周期管理](#3-第一层语义物理显示设备的生命周期管理)\n20:    - 3.1 [硬件端口感知与 PhysicalDisplayId 编码](#31-硬件端口感知与-physicaldisplayid-编码)\n21:    - 3.2 [Hotplug 热插拔与设备注册全链路](#32-hotplug-热插拔与设备注册全链路)\n22:    - 3.3 [Java 框架内部设备流转与 LogicalDisplay 创建流水线](#33-java-框架内部设备流转与-logicaldisplay-创建流水线)\n23:    - 3.4 [SurfaceFlinger Native 层的 Display 实体体系](#34-surfaceflinger-native-层的-display-实体体系)\n24: 4. [第二层语义：逻辑映射与合成管线（LayerStack、Output 与 Display）](#4-第二层语义逻辑映射与合成管线layerstackoutput-与-display)\n25:    - 4.1 [核心实体定义与概念矩阵](#41-核心实体定义与概念矩阵)\n26:    - 4.2 [DisplayDevice 与 Output 的关系](#42-displaydevice-与-output-的关系)\n27:    - 4.3 [LayerStack 的设计哲学与分配机制（与 DisplayID 的解耦）](#\n<truncated 8813 bytes>\nPowerMode, ActiveMode   │                                |\n108: |        │    - Owns: std::shared_ptr<compositionengine::Display>       │                                |\n109: |        +──────────────────────────────┬───────────────────────────────+                                |\n110: |                                       │ (C++ inheritance: is-a)                                        |\n111: |                                       ▼                                                                |\n112: |        +──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────+                                |\n113: |        │  compositionengine::Output (Abstract Composition Target)     │                                |\n114: |        │    - Output::State.layerStack (Filtered LayerStack ID)       │                                |\n115: |        │    - Viewport / Frame / Projection spatial transform matrices│                                |\n116: |        │    - RenderSurface / Framebuffer target render buffer        │                                |\n117: |        +──────────────────────────────┬───────────────────────────────+                                |\n118: |                                       │                                                                |\n119: |      ┌────────────────────────────────┴──────────────────────────────┐                                 |\n120: |      ▼ (Filtered by LayerStack)                                      ▼                                 |","truncated_fields":["content"]}
